    <a href="https://www.lbma.org.uk/membership/how-to-join" class="flex flex-col h-full relative items-start group transform transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 bg-center bg-cover">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between h-full w-full  max-w-lg  min-h-1">
            <div class="">
                                
                                
                                                        							<h3 class="text-28 md:text-34 font-medium leading-tight text-purple mb-4 md:mb-6">How to Join</h3>

                
                                                                                                                                                                                        <div class="text-18 md:text-21 mb-6 text-white"><p>You can apply to join LBMA online now if you have details of three Member attesters to support your application.</p></div>
                                    
